  "body": "### Summary\nTwo pieces of wording, left over from the review of #981 (Fable 5.2 r2, details 2 and 3), still suggest opening Mac-check issues, while a check owed by a merge now goes to the general-review list on #893.\n\n### Scope\n1. `docs/agents/MAC-SESSIONS.md:103-104`: say whether the verify-merges session still runs a check it sends to #893. Proposed: it records the check on #893 and does not run it.\n2. `AGENTS.md:139`: reword « a follow-up of a lot (including a Mac check it owes) », so that it does not imply that Mac-check issues are opened.\n3. The body of #893 lists « device checks » under the `mac/M1` role: align it (cloud/orch).\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] No document tells an agent to open a `host: mac` issue for a device check owed by a merge.",
  "closed_by": null,
