   "body": "Added from the review of #1010 (Fable 5.2):\n- `tooling/docs/fold.py --check` exits 0 on stale H.1 and Counts tallies (it only warns), so CI does not guard them. Consider making it fail.\n- In the next ledger-notes PR, GAP-978 should name Recherche next to pushed topic lists (legacy `ForumSearchView.swift:131` @ 87fe0d1c is `.automatic`; SwiftHFR uses `.pill`).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
